{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53531","headline":"梦游仙赋附诗 二 · 沈亚之","name":"梦游仙赋附诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穠光醉兮，昏緜緜焉。\n与久乐万年春，留连兮其未央。\n（均见《沈下贤文集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}